{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a regular middle class American worker,  a nobody.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glaucon Inc. is a short first person narrative story game, in which you try your best to uncover the truth of your past. By day, Glaucon Inc. is a text based tale of work at an American super corporation. Make your way to work every day and process as many debtors as you can. Your worth is your work, so do your best for the company! A hard working employee is a happy employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866840/extras/8230c6337f3a6973db078a64b84e83b5.avif?t=1752927415\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866840/extras_big/8230c6337f3a6973db078a64b84e83b5.avif?t=1752927415 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forget your past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of work, you may experience strange dreams, in which your world expands into a three dimensional environment, where you can look for clues to your past. An unfathomable experience after the one dimensional text based world of your real life. These dreams are a violation of company policy, and will be dealt with accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866840/extras/94012379bc982b15c2b0b791ec93ccf0.avif?t=1752927415\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866840/extras_big/94012379bc982b15c2b0b791ec93ccf0.avif?t=1752927415 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No questions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disobedience 